+  // browser_core: a page whose process a JavaScript dialog blocks still gives
+  // its keys to the browser, as keys it passed on, and never gets them itself.
+  // Two pages of a site share a process, so a page beside a dialog's was
+  // blocked with it, and no browser shortcut worked from it until the dialog
